WEBVTT

00:13.560 --> 00:16.208
- Congratulations, Your Highness!
- Congratulations, Your Highness!

00:16.240 --> 00:18.912
- Congratulations, Your Highness!
- Congratulations, Your Highness!

02:56.880 --> 02:57.720
=Blossoms of Power=

02:57.728 --> 03:00.700
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:00.700 --> 03:03.660
=Episode 21=

03:03.660 --> 03:05.719
(East Palace)

03:05.719 --> 03:08.800
The auspicious hour has arrived!

03:25.360 --> 03:28.599
Two hearts bound as
one with embroidered silk,

03:28.960 --> 03:32.439
pearl and gem united,
enduring as sun and moon.

03:33.639 --> 03:36.879
Gold-adorned saddle,
jade path leading to the throne,

03:37.240 --> 03:40.599
may each step bring
peace through the years.

03:41.879 --> 03:45.159
First scattering, fine grain
for a bountiful harvest.

03:46.199 --> 03:49.800
Second scattering, beans and grains
for a lasting fortune and longevity.

03:50.520 --> 03:53.759
Third scattering, rice and
millet fill a thousand halls.

03:54.080 --> 03:57.960
May your household
always know abundance.

03:58.639 --> 04:00.400
May your bond last forever,

04:00.560 --> 04:02.400
like twin blossoms on one stem.

04:02.719 --> 04:05.520
May you know peace in every season.

04:09.039 --> 04:10.199
First bow,

04:10.840 --> 04:13.439
honor your parents' love and blessings.

04:13.520 --> 04:16.399
May your union bring them joy.

04:17.720 --> 04:18.879
Second bow,

04:19.959 --> 04:24.839
may your hearts stay forever in harmony.

04:30.639 --> 04:32.439
Share the ceremonial liquor.

04:40.600 --> 04:42.959
To the Crown Princess,
of the Shen clan,

04:43.240 --> 04:46.680
graceful in virtue
and noble in character.

04:47.519 --> 04:51.600
Today, you are invested
as Crown Princess.

04:52.040 --> 04:55.319
The ceremony is complete.
Let the banquet begin!

04:55.320 --> 04:57.920
- Congratulations, Crown Prince.
- Congratulations, Crown Prince.

04:58.000 --> 05:00.750
- Congratulations, Crown Princess.
- Congratulations, Crown Princess.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.560
Your Highness.

05:17.920 --> 05:20.079
His Highness had all
of this prepared for you.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.584
He'll be dining with the guests,

05:21.632 --> 05:23.360
and he was worried you'd get hungry.

05:23.439 --> 05:25.360
He said you may eat whatever you like

05:25.480 --> 05:26.816
and ask for anything you need.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.519
I'll take off this headdress first.

05:29.720 --> 05:30.120
But...

05:30.279 --> 05:31.680
You mustn't, Your Highness!

05:31.800 --> 05:33.000
A bride's headdress

05:33.000 --> 05:34.480
can only be removed by her husband.

05:41.720 --> 05:42.800
Why are you back?

05:42.920 --> 05:44.224
Weren't you joining the banquet?

05:44.399 --> 05:45.680
I knew you'd find it heavy

05:45.800 --> 05:46.944
and you'd be uncomfortable.

05:55.279 --> 05:56.279
Much better.

06:01.639 --> 06:02.800
I'll come back early.

06:17.260 --> 06:21.940
(East Palace)

06:27.199 --> 06:28.279
You may all leave.

06:47.839 --> 06:49.120
I thought

06:49.120 --> 06:50.839
you wouldn't be back until late tonight.

06:51.279 --> 06:52.399
But here you are,

06:52.519 --> 06:53.759
not even four hours later.

06:54.199 --> 06:56.399
All rules are relaxed on a wedding day.

06:57.439 --> 06:59.480
Faced with their frail Crown Prince,

06:59.536 --> 07:01.664
the ministers could only
raise their cups and say,

07:01.750 --> 07:03.504
"Just drink what
you can, Your Highness."

07:04.040 --> 07:06.040
I simply pretended
I was too weak to stay.

07:06.528 --> 07:07.630
Who would dare stop me?

07:19.904 --> 07:21.584
Your Highness, please behave yourself.

07:21.959 --> 07:24.279
On our wedding night,
with my beautiful bride,

07:24.639 --> 07:25.959
perhaps you could teach me

07:26.160 --> 07:27.120
how to behave.

07:30.079 --> 07:31.000
Let go of me!

07:31.480 --> 07:32.560
Put me down!

07:35.680 --> 07:36.639
We had an agreement.

07:36.640 --> 07:39.380
One condition of this marriage
was that we wouldn't cross the line.

07:41.360 --> 07:42.160
Don't be afraid.

07:42.360 --> 07:43.040
I remember.

07:49.240 --> 07:50.319
I'm taking you somewhere.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.560
Where does this secret passage lead?

08:14.864 --> 08:16.070
You'll know when we get there.

08:28.439 --> 08:29.560
Come, Youyou.

08:41.799 --> 08:42.320
Xihe,

08:42.879 --> 08:43.679
follow me.

09:34.399 --> 09:35.200
Father.

09:35.799 --> 09:36.559
Brother.

09:37.399 --> 09:38.240
Youyou.

09:41.799 --> 09:42.519
Father.

09:47.399 --> 09:48.279
Youyou.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.559
My precious girl.

10:02.752 --> 10:04.150
My little girl is all grown up.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.600
Now she's to become someone's wife.

10:10.759 --> 10:12.440
Father, Brother,

10:13.088 --> 10:14.816
you left northwest without permission.

10:15.360 --> 10:17.799
If the court finds out,
you could be in serious trouble.

10:17.799 --> 10:18.399
Don't worry.

10:19.008 --> 10:20.270
I've taken care of everything.

10:20.608 --> 10:23.072
I knew you wanted your father
and brother here to see you off,

10:23.232 --> 10:24.600
but you put the greater good first

10:24.919 --> 10:26.039
and never mentioned it to me.

10:26.759 --> 10:27.720
I only wanted

10:28.039 --> 10:29.360
to make that wish come true.

10:33.679 --> 10:34.399
Your Highness,

10:35.960 --> 10:37.559
you have my deepest gratitude.

10:37.919 --> 10:38.600
We're family now.

10:38.880 --> 10:39.960
There's no need to thank me.

10:41.039 --> 10:42.879
To be a son-in-law of our family,

10:43.000 --> 10:45.264
if you didn't have this much
courage and responsibility,

10:45.279 --> 10:47.200
I wouldn't feel safe
entrusting my sister to you.

10:48.100 --> 10:49.000
You're right, Brother.

10:51.960 --> 10:52.639
Father.

10:54.360 --> 10:55.639
Please accept my bow.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.360
Father-in-law.

11:07.720 --> 11:09.000
Please accept my bow as well.

11:09.070 --> 11:11.056
There are formalities
between ruler and subject.

11:11.559 --> 11:12.240
Your Highness,

11:13.080 --> 11:14.519
you mustn't bow to me like this.

11:15.000 --> 11:15.799
Father-in-law,

11:16.160 --> 11:17.670
here, we aren't ruler and subject.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.000
We're family.

11:20.639 --> 11:21.919
Now that I've married Youyou,

11:22.519 --> 11:23.600
her father

11:23.960 --> 11:25.080
is naturally my father.

11:25.879 --> 11:26.919
And her brother

11:27.200 --> 11:28.200
is my brother.

11:32.080 --> 11:32.759
Father.

11:34.039 --> 11:34.720
The first bow

11:36.360 --> 11:38.399
is for giving me life and raising me.

11:44.600 --> 11:45.279
The second bow

11:46.000 --> 11:48.360
is for all the care and
guidance you've given me.

11:53.759 --> 11:54.519
The third bow

11:55.639 --> 11:56.679
is to bid you farewell.

11:58.256 --> 11:59.630
I might be someone's wife now,

12:01.039 --> 12:02.080
but I'll remember

12:03.120 --> 12:04.159
your teachings.

12:13.840 --> 12:15.150
You've found a worthy husband,

12:15.824 --> 12:17.200
and it's an honor for our family.

12:18.240 --> 12:19.750
May you build a happy home together

12:20.360 --> 12:21.559
and grow old side by side.

12:22.519 --> 12:23.519
Your Highness,

12:25.000 --> 12:26.480
I entrust my precious daughter...

12:29.879 --> 12:30.879
My Youyou

12:32.200 --> 12:33.399
to you.

12:34.720 --> 12:35.639
So please,

12:36.840 --> 12:37.720
respect her,

12:39.600 --> 12:40.399
love her,

12:41.639 --> 12:42.519
and protect her...

12:46.440 --> 12:47.600
For the rest of your lives.

12:48.016 --> 12:49.744
Thank you for placing your trust in me.

12:50.944 --> 12:53.072
You have entrusted me
with your beloved daughter,

12:53.232 --> 12:54.550
and I'll treasure her always.

12:56.639 --> 12:57.960
Xihe and I

12:58.879 --> 13:00.240
will stand by each other for life.

13:01.279 --> 13:02.519
Our love will endure.

13:03.320 --> 13:04.120
Good.

13:04.840 --> 13:05.720
Good.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.399
Good.

13:11.000 --> 13:11.440
Come.

14:01.720 --> 14:02.759
I never would've guessed

14:03.399 --> 14:05.559
you knew how to grill meat.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.480
When I traveled in years past,

14:14.864 --> 14:16.736
I often had to make do
with what I could find.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.440
Grilling was the easiest option.

14:44.240 --> 14:45.720
The skin is crisp and golden,

14:46.279 --> 14:47.600
and the meat is tender and juicy.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.519
It's cooked perfectly.

14:50.919 --> 14:51.799
Have some more.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.080
I really can't eat another bite.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.039
Your Highness!

15:19.519 --> 15:20.799
Those are my chopsticks.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.679
We're married now.

15:23.792 --> 15:25.472
There's no need to fuss over that.

15:27.080 --> 15:27.759
How could you...

15:27.920 --> 15:29.390
Don't you have any sense of propriety?

15:29.399 --> 15:30.480
You're the Crown Prince.

15:31.879 --> 15:32.879
When I'm with you,

15:33.759 --> 15:34.759
I'm just your husband.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.279
Your Highness.

15:48.879 --> 15:50.360
I'm really happy today.

15:52.360 --> 15:53.840
Thank you for arranging everything

15:54.512 --> 15:56.416
so I could see my father and brother.

16:00.559 --> 16:01.840
Youyou, if you're happy,

16:02.840 --> 16:04.240
I'm even happier.

16:16.559 --> 16:18.480
Father, Brother, please take care.

17:26.519 --> 17:27.759
Though today,

17:28.720 --> 17:29.960
I'm grateful to you,

17:32.680 --> 17:33.799
I still ask that you

17:34.039 --> 17:35.640
keep our agreement in mind at all times.

17:48.359 --> 17:49.680
Sharing a bed,

17:51.160 --> 17:52.440
but not a pillow...

17:53.584 --> 17:54.688
I feel sorry for myself.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.839
Would you care to explain

18:27.279 --> 18:28.519
where I was just lying?

18:32.119 --> 18:33.519
I don't know how

18:33.519 --> 18:34.920
you ended up in my arms either.

18:35.640 --> 18:38.319
We were clearly far apart last night.

18:41.200 --> 18:41.839
I know.

18:42.880 --> 18:44.359
You must've been too tired,

18:44.432 --> 18:46.640
and sleeping on only half
the bed wasn't comfortable.

18:46.759 --> 18:49.000
Perhaps we should sleep in
separate beds from now on.

18:50.000 --> 18:50.839
No, no.

18:50.976 --> 18:52.048
That's not necessary.

18:52.528 --> 18:53.904
This bed is plenty big enough.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.599
I promise, no matter how tired I am,

18:57.790 --> 18:59.040
I won't cross the line again.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.519
Here, Du Huo.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.839
Du Huo.

19:34.559 --> 19:35.200
Your Highness!

19:35.350 --> 19:36.448
Get the medicine chest.

19:36.528 --> 19:37.472
Yes, Your Highness.

19:37.920 --> 19:38.599
Let me see.

19:44.839 --> 19:45.680
Use this powder.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.079
It's only a scratch.

19:52.352 --> 19:53.350
Don't worry about it.

19:53.599 --> 19:55.240
It could fester
if we don't treat it now.

19:55.799 --> 19:56.240
No need.

19:58.359 --> 19:58.799
No need.

20:03.039 --> 20:03.920
I'll do it.

20:12.599 --> 20:13.359
Does it hurt badly?

20:15.279 --> 20:16.680
Bring the cleansing balm.

20:17.480 --> 20:17.920
Yes.

20:19.359 --> 20:20.640
That medicine is much gentler.

20:20.759 --> 20:22.720
It won't sting, even on an open wound.

20:34.400 --> 20:35.790
It really doesn't hurt anymore.

20:54.839 --> 20:55.720
Tian Yuan,

20:56.079 --> 20:57.519
help me figure this out.

20:57.839 --> 20:59.720
What did I do wrong just now?

20:59.880 --> 21:02.119
Why did His Highness glare at me?

21:04.119 --> 21:05.559
As trusted attendants,

21:05.559 --> 21:07.559
sometimes we shouldn't be too capable.

21:08.240 --> 21:09.440
Too capable?

21:09.640 --> 21:10.599
Take what just happened.

21:11.072 --> 21:13.000
When Her Highness
asked if you had medicine,

21:13.400 --> 21:14.440
you should've said,

21:14.519 --> 21:15.160
"No."

21:15.400 --> 21:16.720
Then Her Highness

21:16.720 --> 21:18.860
would have had more reason
to fuss over His Highness.

21:18.880 --> 21:20.176
How do you not understand that?

22:46.359 --> 22:47.599
Your Highness.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.720
May I have a word?

22:58.768 --> 23:00.000
Please, don't be so formal.

23:00.000 --> 23:01.152
Go ahead, Grandfather.

23:02.200 --> 23:04.119
I'm deeply honored by your regard,

23:04.519 --> 23:07.400
but I wouldn't presume to
call myself your grandfather.

23:07.759 --> 23:09.359
Still, there is one thing

23:10.960 --> 23:12.680
I hope you'll forgive me for saying.

23:12.800 --> 23:14.400
Please don't be so formal, Grandfather.

23:14.839 --> 23:16.319
Xihe and I are husband and wife.

23:16.340 --> 23:18.160
It's only right that I
honor you as my elder.

23:20.200 --> 23:23.519
Your Highness,
you and Xihe are newlyweds,

23:26.240 --> 23:28.640
but you should still
exercise some restraint.

23:32.799 --> 23:34.960
Yes. I'll remember
your advice, Grandfather.

23:35.519 --> 23:36.500
I'll take my leave now.

23:43.980 --> 23:47.540
(Hanzhang Hall)

23:54.799 --> 23:55.480
Qing.

23:58.279 --> 23:59.480
Is today's meal

23:59.920 --> 24:01.079
to your liking?

24:01.799 --> 24:02.920
It's rare that I get to dine

24:03.640 --> 24:04.839
with you and Changying.

24:05.056 --> 24:06.816
Of course I have a good appetite.

24:16.759 --> 24:17.799
To be honest,

24:18.896 --> 24:21.070
ever since Shen Xihe
married to the Crown Prince,

24:21.400 --> 24:22.599
I've been

24:23.119 --> 24:24.759
worried sick.

24:25.519 --> 24:27.119
Now that I can see you're alright,

24:28.000 --> 24:29.039
as your mother,

24:29.759 --> 24:31.240
I can finally put my mind at ease.

24:44.599 --> 24:45.759
The wedding is over.

24:46.759 --> 24:48.240
The past is behind us now.

24:49.279 --> 24:50.519
If I still made you worry,

24:51.559 --> 24:52.799
I'd be an unfilial son.

24:54.599 --> 24:55.200
Mother,

24:55.960 --> 24:56.759
a toast to you.

25:00.319 --> 25:00.799
Changying.

25:52.119 --> 25:54.240
You look like you've
finally let go of the past.

25:55.039 --> 25:56.319
Even Mother believes that.

25:57.480 --> 25:58.200
But I don't think

26:00.240 --> 26:01.119
that's true.

26:12.720 --> 26:13.880
Then tell me,

26:16.200 --> 26:17.240
what am I really thinking?

26:18.880 --> 26:19.720
You haven't let go.

26:24.279 --> 26:25.440
Neither have I.

26:28.208 --> 26:30.270
But Xihe and the Crown Prince
are married now.

26:30.720 --> 26:31.960
We should wish her well

26:32.000 --> 26:33.792
and hope everything
goes smoothly for her.

26:51.200 --> 26:52.559
I'm going to keep Mother company.

26:53.599 --> 26:54.400
Changqing,

26:55.504 --> 26:57.030
I'll give you some time alone.

27:26.680 --> 27:28.559
(Even if you've gained the upper hand,)

27:29.200 --> 27:30.880
(your time is running out.)

27:31.920 --> 27:33.039
(Xiao Huayong,)

27:33.799 --> 27:36.319
(I'll be waiting for the day
you breathe your last.)

27:49.079 --> 27:51.839
- Greetings, Father, Grandmother.
- Greetings, Father, Grandmother.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.960
Rise.

27:58.960 --> 28:01.519
At last, I've heard Zhaoning

28:01.720 --> 28:03.960
call me "Father."

28:05.559 --> 28:07.759
It truly warms my heart.

28:08.559 --> 28:10.599
These gifts are from

28:10.599 --> 28:11.680
your grandmother and me.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.200
We hope you

28:13.519 --> 28:17.000
will enjoy a lifetime of happiness
and blessings.

28:17.264 --> 28:20.400
- Thank you, Father and Grandmother.
- Thank you, Father and Grandmother.

28:20.599 --> 28:21.559
Rise.

28:21.880 --> 28:23.960
Seeing how devoted you
are to each other today

28:25.119 --> 28:26.599
puts my mind at ease.

28:28.039 --> 28:30.880
When Huayong lived outside the palace,

28:31.039 --> 28:33.839
the East Palace was so cold and empty.

28:34.319 --> 28:36.839
Now that Zhaoning has moved in,

28:37.359 --> 28:38.599
and in time,

28:39.039 --> 28:41.519
we'll find you a few consorts

28:42.359 --> 28:44.440
so you can give me
some great-grandchildren.

28:44.519 --> 28:47.519
Then the East Palace
will truly be lively.

28:48.359 --> 28:49.839
I don't want any consorts.

28:50.319 --> 28:51.200
Nonsense.

28:51.680 --> 28:53.640
How can a Crown Prince have no consorts?

28:54.319 --> 28:56.279
Even before you married Zhaoning,

28:56.359 --> 28:58.279
you had no consorts at all.

28:58.400 --> 28:59.839
That's unusual enough as it is.

29:00.960 --> 29:02.000
Besides,

29:02.160 --> 29:04.200
Zhaoning is new to the palace.

29:04.559 --> 29:06.359
She may feel some unease.

29:06.920 --> 29:09.359
Having sisters by her side
would be a comfort.

29:09.720 --> 29:13.440
Plus, it's also for the sake
of continuing the royal line.

29:13.759 --> 29:16.480
This is a matter of state importance.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.599
I've made a vow

29:19.880 --> 29:22.359
to be with Xihe and no one else
for the rest of my life.

29:22.839 --> 29:23.680
Zhaoning,

29:24.119 --> 29:25.839
what do you think of this?

29:28.359 --> 29:30.480
I have no objections to this matter.

29:31.319 --> 29:34.160
I will follow the wishes
of His Highness and the elders.

29:53.008 --> 29:54.900
I'd like to take a walk
in the imperial garden.

29:54.960 --> 29:56.512
Then I'll return to the palace first.

30:10.799 --> 30:13.000
Your Highness. About what
Empress Dowager said just now,

30:13.040 --> 30:14.990
Crown Princess was
only pretending to be gracious

30:15.160 --> 30:17.000
so no one would call her jealous.

30:17.319 --> 30:18.880
She must be against it deep down.

30:18.880 --> 30:20.400
Please don't take her words to heart.

30:21.039 --> 30:22.440
Don't bother finding her excuse.

30:22.680 --> 30:23.759
She truly doesn't care.

30:26.608 --> 30:27.310
How dare you!

30:27.799 --> 30:28.599
Who are you?

30:28.839 --> 30:30.599
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

30:30.799 --> 30:32.319
I accidentally fell

30:33.000 --> 30:34.200
and caused you offense.

30:38.119 --> 30:39.440
Your Highness,

30:39.720 --> 30:40.640
could you

30:42.000 --> 30:43.400
help me up?

30:51.840 --> 30:53.200
Your Highness!

30:53.744 --> 30:55.490
- Someone, come quickly!
- Your Highness!

30:55.504 --> 30:56.704
His Highness has fainted!

30:56.720 --> 30:58.880
(East Palace)

30:58.880 --> 30:59.440
Your Highness.

30:59.960 --> 31:02.150
That lady is the
Vice Minister of War's second daughter.

31:02.160 --> 31:04.599
She's always been known
for her beauty. What she did today

31:04.880 --> 31:07.056
was clearly meant to secure a
place as your consort.

31:07.359 --> 31:08.960
But after you fainted,

31:08.976 --> 31:09.960
His Majesty was furious,

31:10.032 --> 31:11.824
and the Vice Minister of War
was reprimanded.

31:11.824 --> 31:13.160
The Empress Dowager even declared

31:13.160 --> 31:15.240
that she was a lady of loose morals.

31:15.599 --> 31:17.200
From now on, any lady

31:17.359 --> 31:18.480
who dares make a move on you

31:18.640 --> 31:20.039
will think twice.

31:35.920 --> 31:36.960
Do you have no heart?

31:38.279 --> 31:39.799
I haven't done anything to you.

31:40.070 --> 31:42.144
Ladies are throwing
themselves at your husband,

31:42.279 --> 31:43.440
and you don't care at all?

31:44.799 --> 31:46.559
It's only natural for
you to take consorts.

31:46.880 --> 31:48.000
I'll accept it calmly.

31:48.440 --> 31:49.799
I won't get jealous.

31:51.319 --> 31:52.400
So to you,

31:52.759 --> 31:54.359
I don't really matter.

32:04.400 --> 32:06.519
Of course, you matter.

32:08.240 --> 32:09.200
But you're

32:09.880 --> 32:11.759
a master at making
something out of nothing.

32:14.960 --> 32:15.680
What's this?

32:26.559 --> 32:28.319
You won't let me get close to you,

32:29.119 --> 32:30.400
so I can only draw you

32:30.920 --> 32:31.920
to ease my longing.

32:33.759 --> 32:34.559
Perfect.

32:35.119 --> 32:36.880
Once you take a consort,

32:37.359 --> 32:38.839
you won't be so lonely anymore,

32:39.519 --> 32:41.880
and you won't need
drawings to satisfy yourself.

32:47.440 --> 32:48.039
Your Highness.

32:48.640 --> 32:49.839
Haven't you noticed

32:49.936 --> 32:52.144
Crown Princess has
been acting strangely lately?

32:52.519 --> 32:53.160
I have.

32:54.160 --> 32:55.480
But I don't know why.

32:56.839 --> 32:58.440
Could it be because the Empress Dowager

32:58.440 --> 33:00.000
wanted you to take a consort,

33:00.680 --> 33:02.799
and then other ladies
tried to seduce you?

33:03.079 --> 33:04.440
But I turned them all down.

33:07.200 --> 33:08.559
Once a lady falls in love,

33:08.960 --> 33:10.110
she stops being reasonable.

33:13.079 --> 33:14.920
This must be what they call jealousy.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.759
The Crown Princess is jealous?

33:23.119 --> 33:24.279
I wouldn't dare dream of it.

34:04.759 --> 34:06.039
Greetings, Prince Lie.

34:06.256 --> 34:08.288
What are you doing here,
Young Lady Qingshu?

34:08.440 --> 34:10.159
I came here specifically
to wait for you.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.079
For me?

34:13.456 --> 34:14.848
Is something the matter?

34:15.800 --> 34:17.039
I've heard

34:17.039 --> 34:19.280
of your exploits on the battlefield.

34:20.079 --> 34:22.079
You fought bravely and
struck fear into the enemy.

34:24.599 --> 34:26.320
I've admired you for a long time.

34:26.840 --> 34:27.760
May I ask

34:28.360 --> 34:30.400
whether I might have the honor

34:30.519 --> 34:31.559
of joining you for tea?

34:33.040 --> 34:34.630
I'm flattered, Young Lady Qingshu,

34:35.200 --> 34:36.656
but I don't feel the same way.

34:37.744 --> 34:39.488
I have matters to attend to at home.

34:39.920 --> 34:40.800
Please excuse me.

34:48.079 --> 34:48.880
Young Lady,

34:49.840 --> 34:50.920
what are we going to do?

34:51.960 --> 34:53.199
At this point,

34:53.679 --> 34:54.880
there's only one option left.

34:56.559 --> 34:59.199
His Majesty and the Empress Dowager
want Prince Ning to remarry,

34:59.480 --> 35:00.880
and they have Hu Yingrao in mind.

35:01.072 --> 35:03.630
No wonder you've been visiting
the Hu residence so often lately

35:03.639 --> 35:05.239
and getting so close to Young Lady Hu.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.336
And today, you even...

35:19.840 --> 35:23.000
The Empress Dowager asked the
noble ladies to perform at this banquet

35:23.280 --> 35:24.599
as a discreet way

35:24.670 --> 35:26.720
for the princes to
choose prospective brides.

35:34.340 --> 35:36.380
(Xiao Wenxi, Princess of Ruyang)

35:46.400 --> 35:47.400
It's so hot.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.679
(That smells like verbena.)

36:16.000 --> 36:16.880
Qingshu.

36:17.440 --> 36:18.679
Take a look at my face.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.039
It's so itchy.

36:20.039 --> 36:21.800
You've broken out in red spots.

36:21.960 --> 36:23.000
Red spots?

36:24.559 --> 36:26.039
How did this happen all of a sudden?

36:26.559 --> 36:28.079
I'm about to perform.

36:30.079 --> 36:31.559
Come with me. I'll help you fix it.

36:31.760 --> 36:32.480
I have a way.

36:55.880 --> 36:56.480
Watch out!

36:58.000 --> 36:58.639
Young Lady Hu!

36:58.960 --> 36:59.800
Assassin!

36:59.960 --> 37:00.599
Your Majesty.

37:00.679 --> 37:01.840
I failed in my duty.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.199
I thought

37:03.719 --> 37:05.519
the Crown Princess was
exceptionally capable.

37:05.719 --> 37:08.480
That's why I entrusted
this blessing ceremony to her.

37:08.599 --> 37:10.480
Yet such a suspicious
incident has occurred.

37:10.639 --> 37:12.679
Your Majesty,
please mete out strict punishment.

37:18.230 --> 37:21.170
♪I've hidden so many words♪

37:21.790 --> 37:24.590
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

37:25.460 --> 37:32.430
♪So never uncover♪

37:32.620 --> 37:34.980
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

37:36.110 --> 37:38.840
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

37:39.800 --> 37:45.140
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

37:46.900 --> 37:49.720
♪Every answer I gave♪

37:50.520 --> 37:53.370
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

37:54.160 --> 37:57.530
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

37:57.790 --> 38:01.100
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:04.070 --> 38:07.510
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:08.500 --> 38:10.830
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

38:12.100 --> 38:17.860
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

38:19.270 --> 38:22.400
♪It's a shame I never could♪

38:22.850 --> 38:25.860
♪Give you a moon in return♪

38:25.970 --> 38:32.610
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

38:32.610 --> 38:36.280
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

38:37.150 --> 38:39.910
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

38:40.350 --> 38:43.480
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

38:43.920 --> 38:49.870
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

38:51.270 --> 38:54.820
♪You'll never♪

38:55.100 --> 39:04.570
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

39:30.740 --> 39:34.220
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
